                                "sense_id": "daac6da5-7665-3c8e-9025-4d30d9ede46c",
                                "text": "A group of bronzes of the late Western Chou were uncovered in Chingshan County, Hupeh Province, and 25 pieces of stone ching (musical chimes) with a painted design of the State of Chu were found in Chiangling County of the same province."
